{
	"name": "Approve Inistate entries by email",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Approve Inistate entries by email\nWhen an entry enters your approval state, the approver gets an email with **Approve** / **Reject** buttons. Their answer is performed back in Inistate as the matching activity.\n\n**Setup**\n1. In every Inistate node pick the **same workspace and module**, and an Inistate credential.\n2. In the trigger, pick the state entries wait in (e.g. *Pending Approval*).\n3. In **Settings**, set the approver, sender, the approve/reject **activity names** exactly as they appear in Inistate, and how many days to wait.\n4. In **Approve in Inistate** / **Reject in Inistate**, pick those two activities and fill any required fields.\n5. Add an SMTP credential to **Ask approver by email**.\n\nThe entry is re-read after the answer arrives: if someone already acted on it in Inistate, nothing is performed.",
				"width": 560,
				"height": 380
			},
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-460, -420],
			"name": "Setup",
			"id": "6cddc690-8128-45bc-af1b-1610593cb199"
		},
